Package: skillkorp-k20
Version: 1.0.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1, udev, gir1.2-notify-0.7
Recommends: gir1.2-ayatanaappindicator3-0.1 | gir1.2-appindicator3-0.1
Maintainer: nplacide <nplacide95@gmail.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/ElMajor76/skillkorp-k20
Description: Linux driver, CLI, and GUI for SkillKorp K20 Ultimate gaming keyboard
 Native Linux implementation of hardware driver, CLI tool (k20ctl),
 and modern GTK 4 / Libadwaita GUI for the SkillKorp K20 Ultimate
 compact 75% mechanical wireless keyboard (Yichip YC3121 SoC / CX71D board).
